    intro: "In him we have redemption through his blood, the forgiveness of our trespasses, according to the riches of his grace. As far as the east is from the west, so far does he remove our transgressions from us. I, I am he who blots out your transgressions for my own sake, and remembers your sins no more. God's forgiveness is complete, costly and free. It is the root from which our forgiving of others grows.",
